It is finally Friday, and the busy week is almost over.
We are eating lunch together in the bright canteen.
I am sitting at a large table together with my team.
Peter, our designer Eva, and our tester Mads are here too.
We are all tired, but we are very happy.
The new project has been exciting.
"We have worked really hard," Peter says and smiles.
"Yes, we have solved many complex problems," I reply.
As software engineers, we have written a lot of code this week.
"And I have tested it all," Mads laughs.
"Luckily, you have not found many mistakes," Peter teases.
Eva shows us her beautiful design on her phone.
She has worked as a designer for many years.
We talk about our different tasks while we eat.
It is lovely to get to know my colleagues better.
We have become a really good team.
I take a bite of my food and look at them.
I look forward to continuing the project with them.
